      "id": "github:1158459932",
      "name": "OpenFarm",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "以田块为锚点的开源自托管作物遥感/田间情报平台（BSD-3-Clause）：绘制或导入 GeoJSON/KML 田块边界，接入 Sentinel-2 影像计算 NDVI/EVI/SAVI 时间序列，提供异常与阈值警报、巡查、采样分区、地图和分享报告；支持 Docker/PostGIS/TiTiler 部署。项目较新，未做运行验证。",
      "homepage": "https://openfarm.earth",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/superzero11/OpenFarm",
      "github_repository_id": 1158459932,
      "license": "BSD-3-Clause",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/superzero11/OpenFarm/license",
      "features": [
        "绘制或上传 GeoJSON/KML 田块边界并自动计算面积",
        "Sentinel-2 NDVI/EVI/SAVI 多指数监测与 24 个月历史回填",
        "按指数配置阈值/跌幅警报",
        "地理标记巡查与照片记录",
        "采样分区、地图图层与分享报告"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "Docker Compose 启动 Web、API、TiTiler、PostGIS、Redis、MinIO 和 Celery worker"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "Next.js",
        "FastAPI",
